          shows how linear algebra can be used to find the explicit formula for the Fibonacci sequence. <!-- shown on the front cover. -->
    <idx><h>Leonardo of Pisa</h></idx>
    <idx><h>Fibonacci</h></idx>
        </p>
      </blockquote>
  </introduction>
